# SolarEPC-Pro Enterprise Edition Walkthrough

I have upgraded the platform to the **Enterprise Edition**, adding real-world data, visual tools, and white-labeling.

## New Features (Phase 5)
- **Real-World Weather**: Integrates **PVGIS** for accurate TMY data.
- **Equipment Database**: Select specific modules (Jinko, Canadian Solar) and inverters (Huawei, Sungrow).
- **Layout Visualizer**: 2D Plot of array layout with shadow zones.
- **Hybrid Storage**: Advanced **Peak Shaving** simulation for BESS.
- **White-Labeling**: Upload company logo and customize report headers.

## Previous Features (Phases 1-4)
- **Professional Modules**: Inverter Sizing, Cable Sizing, Geometry, PR Analysis, Financials.
- **Core**: PVLib Simulation, Load Profiling, BOM.

